          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>Holding your weapon aloft, you fill it with divine energy. On your next Strike with that weapon before the start of your next turn, you gain a +1 status bonus to the attack roll and the weapon deals an additional <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span> spirit damage, and the Strike gains the sanctified trait. <em>Weapon surge</em> ends once you complete this Strike or the weapon leaves your possession.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The attack deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> additional spirit damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The attack deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">3d6</span> additional spirit damage.</p>\n",
